---
// "#distributors" — ported verbatim from reference/home.html's
// <section class="distribution" id="distributors" data-astro-cid-lsleewa2>.
//
// IMPORTANT FINDING (see NOTES.md): there is NO zip-code lookup form/input
// anywhere on the live homepage. The brief describes a "ZIP lookup control"
// to build functionally, but the actual source has only a plain sentence —
// "...enter your zip code here for the closest distributor to you." — where
// "enter your zip code here" is itself just a mailto: link
// (mailto:info@stirlingflavors.com), not a form control. Reproduced exactly
// as a link, not invented as a functional zip form.
---

<section class="distribution" id="distributors">
  <div class="glows" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="glow glow-blue"></span>
    <span class="glow glow-gold"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="shell inner">
    <div class="top">
      <h2 class="h2">We don't sell direct.<br />Our distributors do it better.</h2>
      <div class="body">
        <p>
          Distributors are the backbone of the supply chain, and we are grateful to all. This year,
          we are pleased to announce Houston's has partnered with Stirling Flavors to distribute
          products nationwide and we encourage you to purchase through them. They have competitive
          programs and a national footprint, making lead times shorter and order deliveries more
          manageable. Reach out your local Houston's rep for more information.
        </p>
        <p>
          As we focus on building distributor programs, Stirling will no longer be available direct
          to consumers. If you need product for your shop,
          <a href="mailto:info@stirlingflavors.com">enter your zip code here</a> for the closest
          distributor to you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="cards">
      <li class="glass" data-reveal="0">
        <h3 class="h3">Unsurpassed Product Quality</h3>
        <p>Pure cane sugar and real fruit juice concentrates, cool-blended so the flavor survives the pour.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="glass" data-reveal="1">
        <h3 class="h3">National Distribution</h3>
        <p>Houston's carries the full line coast to coast — shorter lead times and deliveries you can plan around.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="glass" data-reveal="2">
        <h3 class="h3">Aggressive Pricing</h3>
        <p>Concentrated formulas mean fewer ounces per drink, so the case goes further than the invoice suggests.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .distribution {
    background: var(--pink);
    color: #fff;
    padding-block: clamp(64px, 9vw, 132px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .glows {
    pointer-events: none;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }
  .glow {
    filter: blur(70px);
    opacity: 0.5;
    border-radius: 50%;
    position: absolute;
  }
  .glow-blue {
    background: var(--blue);
    width: 40vw;
    height: 40vw;
    animation: 30s ease-in-out infinite drift-b;
    top: -14%;
    right: -6%;
  }
  .glow-gold {
    background: var(--gold);
    width: 30vw;
    height: 30vw;
    animation: 34s ease-in-out infinite drift-c;
    bottom: -12%;
    left: -4%;
  }
  .inner {
    z-index: 1;
    position: relative;
  }
  .top {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
    align-items: end;
    gap: 64px;
    display: grid;
  }
  .body {
    gap: 18px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    display: grid;
  }
  .body a {
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .body a:hover {
    color: var(--plum);
  }
  .cards {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
  }
  .glass {
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(140%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(140%);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glass);
    transition: transform var(--t-card);
    background: #1b0f224d;
    padding: 34px;
  }
  .glass:hover {
    transform: translateY(-7px);
  }
  .glass p {
    color: #ffffffd1;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
